    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Aryth, Nymm, Olarune, Vult, or Zarantyr clan heritage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>With the aid of your allies, you hone in on vital points of the enemy. On a successful melee strike, you can deal an extra 1d4 extra precision damage to any creature that’s within reach of at least two of your allies.</p>"
